### Todo CRUD — spring-boot-3-web-app (Spring MVC)
# Run the app, then click ▶ next to each request.
# Demonstrates the full MVC flow: Controller -> Service -> Repository.

@host = http://localhost:8080

### Create a todo (POST and PUT both map to createOrUpdate)
# Returns 201 Created with a Location header pointing at the new todo.
POST {{host}}/api/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Learn Spring MVC",
  "description": "Understand the DispatcherServlet request flow"
}

### Get all todos
GET {{host}}/api/todos

### Get one todo by id
GET {{host}}/api/todos/1

### Mark a todo completed (PATCH)
PATCH {{host}}/api/todos/1

### Update via PUT (same handler as POST — include the id)
PUT {{host}}/api/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "title": "Learn Spring MVC (updated)",
  "description": "ResponseEntity + status codes"
}

### Delete by id (path variable)
DELETE {{host}}/api/todos/1

### Delete by body
DELETE {{host}}/api/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 2,
  "title": "to delete",
  "description": "..."
}
